Compare authority, effective interval, applicability to the study, and explicit supersession for every protocol pair. Retain a mandate only when one approved version controls the complete planned window. If unresolved clauses would change timing, equipment, measurement, or personnel, place that experiment in precedenceConflicts and keep it out of scheduling.
